-- A world of six: Nord and Dead are tags, keys the id column, Ghost the mark of the minted. Spawn adds rows at the barrier; it never edits the living.
-- Two dead Nords (keys 0 and 3) each spawn one Ghost; minted keys 6 and 7.
--! registry ../registries/022-barrier-granularity-a.reg
--! expect-n 8
--! expect keys = 0 1 2 3 4 5 6 7
--! expect nord = 1 1 0 1 0 0 1 1
--! expect dead = 1 0 0 1 0 1 1 1
--! expect ghost = 0 0 0 0 0 0 1 1

Nord & Dead , spawn Ghost
